	)
	(text "VADC = VSYS / 3.7  |  5 V -> 1.351 V\n5.5 V + 1% resistor worst case -> < 1.51 V\nADC attenuation: 6 dB; calibration + averaging in firmware.\nU3 is an analog FET switch, NOT a logic buffer."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 28.702 175.768 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "58ffbdee-e9da-5325-9c84-4b8d6c0ba47e")
	)
	(text "USB-C POWER INPUT  |  5 V regulated supply, >= 1 A"
